    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128478385\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Trials of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478386\" id=\"p1\">brought as a <span class=\"key-word\">lamb</span> to the slaughter, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/53?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Isa. 53:7</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Mosiah 14:7</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478387\" id=\"p2\">laid hold on Jesus led him away to <span class=\"key-word\">Caiaphas</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p57#p57\">Matt. 26:57</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478388\" id=\"p3\">bound him … delivered him to <span class=\"key-word\">Pontius Pilate</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Matt. 27:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478389\" id=\"p4\">when he was accused … he answered <span class=\"key-word\">nothing</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Matt. 27:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478390\" id=\"p5\">they all <span class=\"key-word\">condemned</span> him to be guilty of death, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p64#p64\">Mark 14:64</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478391\" id=\"p6\"><span class=\"key-word\">Pilate</span> asked him, Art thou the King of the Jews, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Mark 15:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478392\" id=\"p7\">clothed him with purple, and plaited a crown of <span class=\"key-word\">thorns</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Mark 15:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478393\" id=\"p8\">shall be delivered unto the Gentiles, and … <span class=\"key-word\">mocked</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">Luke 18:32</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478394\" id=\"p9\">men that held Jesus <span class=\"key-word\">mocked</span> him, and smote him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p63#p63\">Luke 22:63</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478395\" id=\"p10\">Art thou the <span class=\"key-word\">Christ</span>? tell us, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p67#p67\">Luke 22:67</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478396\" id=\"p11\">they said, What need we any further <span class=\"key-word\">witness</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p71#p71\">Luke 22:71</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478397\" id=\"p12\">said Pilate … I find no <span class=\"key-word\">fault</span> in this man, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Luke 23:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478398\" id=\"p13\">they cried, saying, <span class=\"key-word\">Crucify</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/23?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Luke 23:21</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">John 19:15</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478399\" id=\"p14\">expedient … one man should <span class=\"key-word\">die</span> for the people, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p50#p50\">John 11:50</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478400\" id=\"p15\">led him away to <span class=\"key-word\">Annas</span> first, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">John 18:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478401\" id=\"p16\">high <span class=\"key-word\">priest</span> then asked Jesus of his disciples, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">John 18:19</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478402\" id=\"p17\"><span class=\"key-word\">Pilate</span> … said, What accusation bring ye, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">John 18:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478403\" id=\"p18\">when he was <span class=\"key-word\">reviled</span>, reviled not again, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">1 Pet. 2:23</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128478404\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">Acts 8:32</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Mosiah 14:7</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">15:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
